First, I create a Dockerfile in my project folder.

Then I build the image:
`docker build -t image-1 .`

Next, I create and run a container:
`docker run -dit --name cont-1 image-1`

Then I login to Docker Hub:
`docker login`

After that, I tag the image with my username:
`docker tag image-1 username/image-1`

Finally, I push the image:
`docker push username/image-1`
================================================================
First, I create a volume:
`docker volume create my-volume`

Then I attach it while running the container:
`docker run -dit --name cont-1 -v my-volume:/data image-1`

Here, the volume is mounted to `/data` inside the container.

